flowchart TD
    %% ===== Styles =====
    classDef user fill:#EEF2FF,stroke:#4F46E5,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111827
    classDef ui fill:#EFF6FF,stroke:#2563EB,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111827
    classDef api fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111827
    classDef ai fill:#FFF7ED,stroke:#EA580C,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111827
    classDef ext fill:#FEF2F2,stroke:#DC2626,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111827
    classDef store fill:#F8FAFC,stroke:#475569,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111827
    classDef decision fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#111827,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#111827

    A([User Opens App]):::user --> B{Authenticated?}:::decision

    B -->|No| C[Login Page\nGoogle OAuth or Guest]:::ui
    C --> D[Create Session / Guest Context]:::api
    D --> E[Open Chat Workspace]:::ui

    B -->|Yes| E

    E --> F{User Action}:::decision

    %% Chat path
    F -->|Ask Symptom Question| G[POST /api/chat with message]:::api
    G --> H{File Attached?}:::decision

    H -->|No| I[Try Bedrock (Claude)]:::ai
    I --> J{Bedrock Success?}:::decision
    J -->|Yes| K[Return Structured Health Guidance\n+ Safety Advisory + Disclaimer]:::api
    J -->|No + Fallback Allowed| L[Route to Gemini Fallback]:::ai
    L --> K
    J -->|No + Fallback Blocked| M[Return Error Response]:::api

    %% Document path
    H -->|Yes (PDF/Image)| N[Validate + Normalize Document]:::api
    N --> O[Store report metadata per user]:::store
    O --> P[Document Analysis via Gemini Path]:::ai
    P --> Q[Return summary, abnormal values,\nurgency hints, safety advisory]:::api

    %% Other features
    F -->|Find Nearby Hospital| R[GET /api/hospitals/nearby]:::api
    R --> S[Google Places Lookup]:::ext
    S --> T[Hospital list with distance,\nopen status, emergency indicators]:::ui

    F -->|Manage Medical History| U[GET/POST/DELETE /api/medical-history]:::api
    F -->|Manage Lab Reports| V[GET/POST/DELETE /api/lab-reports]:::api
    F -->|Manage Prescriptions| W[GET/POST/DELETE /api/prescriptions]:::api

    %% End states
    K --> X([Render AI Response in Chat UI]):::ui
    Q --> X
    T --> X
    U --> X
    V --> X
    W --> X
    M --> Y([Show Error + Retry Guidance]):::ui

    %% Legend-ish connectors to external services
    I -.calls.-> Z1[(AWS Bedrock)]:::ext
    P -.calls.-> Z2[(Google Gemini)]:::ext
    R -.calls.-> Z3[(Google Places API)]:::ext
